text = "Q to Hide/Show this tool-tip

---=\\\\MOVEMENT//=---
Space to Jump & DoubleJump
Shift to Run
Right click while running to slide
Jump while sliding to slide-jump
Ctrl to crouch & crouch-jump 
Run along wall to wall run
Jump into wall to wall slide
Jump against wall to wall kick
After Jump press Slide to Dive
Jump into wall after Dive to Wall Climb

---=\\\\ESPER POWERS//=---
Hold Left Click on objects to pick up
Left Click to fire objects

ESC to close game"

